{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>For</b> — Even though we do not find written that Jeroboam died by the sword, we know that the word of HaShem is true. Or the prophet said: \"the house of Jeroboam,\" and Amaziah lied, in order that the king's anger burn against him to put him to death. And behold, Jeroboam was silent and did not answer Amaziah a reply."], :book :amos, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 7, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Amos -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/amos"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:18:28.145512024Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}